    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">内容</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Claudette_Vance:_Lord_of_Thundercloud\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">库罗德特·万斯：雷云之主</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Strategy\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">策略</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Vs._Caludette\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">对决 库罗德特</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Overall_Judgement\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">总体评价</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Claudette_Vance:_Lord_of_Thundercloud\">库罗德特·万斯：雷云之主</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FClaudette_Guide%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/a/a1/Claudette_GB.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20160602033149\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Claudette GB\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/a/a1/Claudette_GB.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20160602033149\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"254\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Claudette GB.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Claudette_GB.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Claudette_GB.jpg\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<ul><li>BP：11</li>\n<li>身高：4</li>\n<li>攻击：1</li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p><p>‘君王’这个称呼低估了她。她可能是第一部《女皇之刃》中最强的直接伤害型书之一。  <a href=\"/wiki/Claudette_Vance\" title=\"Claudette Vance\">库罗德特</a>  她毫不留情，对于任何轻视她行为的人都会予以惩罚。既能掌控战斗节奏，又能在最出其不意的时刻造成伤害，可以说与她战斗就如同陷入一场地狱般的雷暴之中。\n\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Strategy\">策略</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FClaudette_Guide%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/c/c2/Claudette_%2822%29.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20160602034027\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Claudette (22)\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/c/c2/Claudette_%2822%29.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20160602034027\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"243\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Claudette (22).jpg\" data-image-key=\"Claudette_%2822%29.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Claudette_(22).jpg\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>库罗德特就是伤害的代名词。她是纯粹的、未经雕琢的伤害。她拥有这款游戏所能提供的一些最疯狂的MOD加成(她拥有第一代《女皇之刃》系列中最强的物理攻击力，达到+6！)，其战斗风格只能用「噩梦般」来形容，玩家几乎不费吹灰之力就能让库罗德特摧毁大部分对手。不过需要注意的是‘雷鸣’的威力，虽然它不直接造成伤害，但能强制对手在2回合内只能‘跳跃’，让你轻松布局，在无直接风险的情况下造成巨大伤害。此外，她是少数几个在格挡时能获得+1 MOD加成，并且在招架时能对敌人反弹伤害的角色之一！这反过来也促使库罗德特采取极具侵略性的打法，与对手进行短兵相接的碰撞。\n\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/3/3f/Claudette_12.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20160602033158\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Claudette 12\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/3/3f/Claudette_12.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20160602033158\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"242\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Claudette 12.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Claudette_12.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Claudette_12.jpg\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure><p>她的招式组合则有些独辟蹊径。虽然她拥有人们熟悉的‘基础’突刺和挥砍(使用挥砍会禁用突刺和红技，使用突刺则会禁用挥砍)，但她完全没有‘佯攻’技能，取而代之的是‘头槌’，一种能让库罗德特在对手格挡时也能造成伤害的攻击，以及她的‘剑柄攻击’，虽然威力较弱，但速度很快，且能将对手推入一个状态，便于衔接‘雷鸣’并迫使对手按她的意愿行动。她还拥有自我恢复能力，即她的‘扩展距离：后跳’(不过，每次使用只需1 BP)，让她在需要时能稍微回复生命。此外，由于她独特的剑刃特性，她是少数能直接使用‘下劈：猛击’击碎对手盾牌和武器的剑士之一，这使她在面对坦克流战术时能直接将其封锁瓦解。\n\n</p><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Vs._Caludette\">对决 库罗德特</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FClaudette_Guide%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/7/76/Claudette_17.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20160602033849\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Claudette 17\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"244\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Claudette 17.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Claudette_17.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/7/76/Claudette_17.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20160602033849\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/7/76/Claudette_17.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20160602033849\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Claudette 17\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/7/76/Claudette_17.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20160602033849\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"244\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Claudette 17.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Claudette_17.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/7/76/Claudette_17.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20160602033849\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Claudette_17.jpg\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>与雷神对战确实是个棘手的问题。首先，你很可能无法在戳刺战中胜过她，迫使你必须转而寻找偷袭的机会，同时要避免陷入格挡之类的缠斗，否则会遭到电击刺痛。和大多数持有武器的人一样，缴械能使她陷入困境，因为她除了踢击以外的所有攻击都算武器攻击。此外，她剑柄以外的攻击也相当「迟缓」，这意味着如果她发动攻击，使用虚招或你自己的突刺可以成为有效的应对选项。她还拥有相当高的SCORE评分，加上略低于平均水平的体力值，这使她成为重击手，但绝不是坦克。快速、有选择性的打击可以消磨她，而她没有强大的治疗手段，很快就能让局势转向对你有利。少数擅长此道的人还能迫使她进入远距离战斗，然后从那里进行戳刺。只是要小心雷击，否则局势可能会逆转……\n\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Overall_Judgement\">总体评价</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FClaudette_Guide%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/8/85/2P_CLAUDETTE.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20160602033134\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"2P CLAUDETTE\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"255\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"2P CLAUDETTE.jpg\" data-image-key=\"2P_CLAUDETTE.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/8/85/2P_CLAUDETTE.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20160602033134\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/8/85/2P_CLAUDETTE.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20160602033134\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"2P CLAUDETTE\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/8/85/2P_CLAUDETTE.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20160602033134\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"255\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"2P CLAUDETTE.jpg\" data-image-key=\"2P_CLAUDETTE.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/8/85/2P_CLAUDETTE.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20160602033134\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:2P_CLAUDETTE.jpg\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>说实话，她很强。绝对擅长战斗。直接与她对抗很难，而试图绕道接近她也同样棘手。凭借一招能穿透防御的技能，加上她携带的巨大MOD，库罗德特几乎更适合当Boss！难怪她在排行榜上名列前茅，还成为了叛乱女皇！如果你不得不与她战斗，只希望你能使用非金属武器，或者专注于格挡……\n\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<ul><li><b>技能等级：初学者／高级</b></li>\n<li><b>等级：S  </b></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260821131304\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.010 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.014 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 16/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_queensblade:pcache:idhash:27183-0!sseVary=Reg